== A. engine.execution_options(postgresql_readonly=True), default isolation (READ COMMITTED)
  SHOW transaction_read_only: on | iso: read committed
  [A-engine-opt] INSERT rejected: DBAPIError/ReadOnlySQLTransactionError/SQLSTATE=25006: <class 'asyncpg.exceptions.ReadOnlySQLTransactionError'>: cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction
  warnings raised: []
== B. same engine, plain (non-OptionEngine) checkout afterwards: leak across pool?
  plain engine (shares pool) SHOW transaction_read_only: off
  [B-plain-after] INSERT ACCEPTED (not read-only)
== C. connection-level execution_options(postgresql_readonly=True) before first statement
  SHOW transaction_read_only: on
  [C-conn-opt] INSERT rejected: DBAPIError/ReadOnlySQLTransactionError/SQLSTATE=25006: <class 'asyncpg.exceptions.ReadOnlySQLTransactionError'>: cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction
== C2. after an autobegun statement (the 'only before txn' trap)
  ERROR setting option mid-txn: InvalidRequestError This connection has already initialized a SQLAlchemy Transaction() object via begin() or autobegin; postgresql_readonly may not be altered unless rollback() or commit() is called first.
== D. leak check: plain engine connection after C (does pooled DBAPI connection keep readonly=True?)
  SHOW transaction_read_only: off
== E. explicit isolation_level=SERIALIZABLE + readonly (docstring's supported case)
  SHOW: on serializable
  [E-serializable] INSERT rejected: DBAPIError/ReadOnlySQLTransactionError/SQLSTATE=25006: <class 'asyncpg.exceptions.ReadOnlySQLTransactionError'>: cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction
  after leaving: plain checkout:
  SHOW: off read committed
== F. engine isolation_level='READ COMMITTED' explicit + postgresql_readonly (create_async_engine level)
  SHOW: on read committed
  [F-explicit-RC] INSERT rejected: DBAPIError/ReadOnlySQLTransactionError/SQLSTATE=25006: <class 'asyncpg.exceptions.ReadOnlySQLTransactionError'>: cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction
== G. AsyncSession + sessionmaker bound to ro_engine (the shape a tool would use)
  SHOW: on
  [G] rejected: DBAPIError/ReadOnlySQLTransactionError/SQLSTATE=25006: <class 'asyncpg.exceptions.ReadOnlySQLTransactionError'>: cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction
== H. commit then re-use on ro_engine: still read-only in 2nd transaction?
  2nd txn SHOW: on
